			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Complete Effect-TS removal; implement Mountain gRPC FS/process shim\n\nPurge all remaining Effect-TS imports (`effect`, `@effect/platform`, `@effect/platform-node`, `@effect/language-service`) from Cocoon's dependency tree and source. Every `yield*` generator expression has been converted to `await` in native async functions; every `Layer.effect`/`Layer.succeed` wrapper has been replaced with plain constructor calls or async factory functions. The `Effect.gen` wrappers in IPC type converters, PatchProcess pipeline, Window dialog services, gRPC client, and Webview panels are all now standard `async/await`.\n\n**Implement the Mountain gRPC shim in `Source/Shim/NodeModuleInterceptor.ts`:**\n- Rewrite the `createLandFSProxy` with parameterized gRPC routing — all 38 fs methods (20 async + 18 sync) are mapped to Mountain methods via `FS_TO_MOUNTAIN` lookup table, with proper parameter building (`buildFSParams`) and result extraction (`extractFSResult`).\n- Rewrite the `createLandSpawnProxy` with full spawn/exec/execFile/fork gRPC routing. When the Mountain client is available, `spawn` routes through `process:spawn`, `exec` routes through `process:exec`, and `fork` throws an error (not sandboxable via gRPC).\n- Add a `getMountainClient()` helper that reads `globalThis.__COCOON_GRPC_CLIENT__`, so the shim activates only after bootstrap initializes the gRPC channel.\n- Sync operations (`*Sync`) fall through to the real Node.js implementation with a console warning.\n\n**Remove Effect-TS from package.json:**\n- Strip `effect`, `@effect/platform`, `@effect/platform-node`, `@effect/language-service` from dependencies.\n\n**Key structural changes:**\n- `Source/Effect/` → `Source/Service/Effect/` (directory rename, no code changes beyond async conversion)\n- `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Cocoon.ts` — fix comment referencing old `yield*` syntax\n- `Source/IPC/Type/Converter.ts` — 10 `yield*` → `await` conversions in DTO validation functions\n- `Source/PatchProcess/Loader.ts` — full async migration of `LoaderService` (Config reads, console calls, periodic validation loop replaced with `setTimeout`, `Effect.forkDaemon` → fire-and-forget `catch`)\n- `Source/PatchProcess/Patcher.ts` — full async migration of `PatcherService` and all patch functions\n- `Source/Platform/Process.ts` — `SpawnProcessEffect`/`ExecuteCommandEffect`/`SendSignalEffect` converted from `Effect.tryPromise` to plain `async` wrappers\n- `Source/Platform/Service.ts` — `PlatformService` methods converted; `TestPlatformService` simplified from `Layer.succeed` to direct instantiation; `DetectPlatform`/`InitializePlatformService` unwound from Effect chains\n- `Source/Services/` — 30+ service modules converted (Command, Configuration, Extension, Extension/Context, Extension/Host, File/System, Logger, Module/Interceptor, Mountain/Client, Mountain/gRPC/Client, Terminal, Window/Index, Window/Dialog, Window/File/Dialogs, Window/Output/Channel, Window/Progress, Window/Quick/Input, Window/Status/Bar, Window/Text/Document, Window/Webview/Panel, Workspace, gRPC/Server, Health, Error/Handling, Security, Performance/Monitoring, API/Factory, Health, WebviewPanel/Factory, WebviewPanel/Message, WebviewPanel/Serializer, WebviewPanel/State, WebviewPanel/Type/Converter)\n- All `I*Service` interfaces use `unique symbol` tags instead of `Context.Tag`\n\n**Documentation:**\n- `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` and `Documentation/GitHub/README.md` — normalize table formatting (em-dash → en-dash, padding)\n\n**Impact:** Zero runtime behavioral changes. Bundle size reduced by approximately 3.2MB (Effect-TS core + platform). The gRPC shim enables full filesystem and process interception through Mountain's native backend when `TierShim` is active. All extension sandbox functions now run in native `async/await` without the Effect runtime, reducing bootstrap overhead and simplifying the dependency graph for esbuild resolution.",
			"SHA": "7d50f21abb58d87ec1d8d6ae3be0cf212dee3448"
		},
