			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Annotate Window dialog modules with EFX-30 migration TODO\n\nAdd `TODO(EFX-30)` markers to the JSDoc module headers of `Dialog.ts` and `File/Dialogs.ts`, flagging their `Effect.gen` wrappers for conversion to `async/await` once the callers in `Window/Index.ts` migrate.\n\nNo runtime changes — documentation only.",
